#: config.cpp:61
msgid "IceWM Theme Selector"
msgstr "Tri`nh cho.n theme IceWM"

#: config.cpp:65
msgid "Make your IceWM selection by clicking on a theme here. "
msgstr "Click va`o theme o+? dda^y dde^? cho.n IceWM "

#: config.cpp:68
msgid ""
"To manage your IceWM themes, simply click on the link below to open a "
"Konqueror window. Once shown, you will be able to add or remove native IceWM "
"themes, by uncompressing <b>http://icewm.themes.org/</b> theme files into "
"this directory, or creating directory symlinks to existing IceWM themes on "
"your system."
msgstr ""
"DDe^? qua?n li' them IceWm, ddo+n gia?n chi? ca^`n click va` mo+? cu+?a so^? Konqueror"
"du+o+'i dda^y . Khi dda~ hie^.n, ba.n co' the^? the^m hay go+~ bo? ca'c native IceWm"
"theme, pha' ne'n ca'c file theme tu+` <b> <b>http://icewm.themes.org/</b> va`o thu+ mu.c"
"na`y hay ta.o symlink cho thu+ mu.c theme IceWm dda~ to^`n ta.i trong he^. tho^'ng cu?a ba.n ."

#: config.cpp:77
msgid "Open Konqueror Window at KDE's IceWM theme directory"
msgstr "Mo+? cu+?a so^? Konqueror o+? thu+ mu.c IceWm cu?a KDE"

#: config.cpp:80
msgid "IceWM Decoration Settings"
msgstr "Thie^'t la^.p bo^' tri' cu+?a so^?"

#: config.cpp:83
msgid "Use theme &title text colors"
msgstr "Du`ng ma`u &tie^u dde^`text cu?a theme"

#: config.cpp:86
msgid ""
"When selected, titlebar colors will follow those set in the IceWM theme. If "
"not selected, the current KDE titlebar colors will be used instead."
msgstr ""
"Khi ddu+o+.c cho.n, ma`u titlebar se~ theo ca'c thie^'t la^.p trong IceWM theme ."
"Ne^'u kho^ng ddu+o+.c cho.n, Ma`u titlebar KDE hie^.n ta.i se~ ddu+o+.c du`ng ."

#: config.cpp:91
msgid "&Show title bar on top of windows"
msgstr "&Hie^.n titlebar no^?i"

#: config.cpp:94
msgid ""
"When selected, all window titlebars will be shown at the top of each window, "
"otherwise they will be shown at the bottom."
msgstr ""
"Khi ddu+o+.c cho.n, mo^.i titlebar cu?a cu+?a so^? se~ hie^.n tre^n mo.i cu+?a"
"so^? kha'c, ne^'u kho^ng, no' se~ hie^.n ra o+? du+o+'i dda'y ."

#: config.cpp:99
msgid "&Menu button always shows application mini icon"
msgstr "&Nu't thu+.c ddo+n luo^n hie^.n mini icon cu?a chu+o+ng tri`nh "

#: config.cpp:102
msgid ""
"When selected, all titlebar menu buttons will have the application icon "
"shown. If not selected, the current theme's defaults are used instead."
msgstr ""
"Khi ddu+o+.c cho.n, mo.i nu't menu titlebar se~ hie^.n ca'c icon chu+o+ng tri`nh ."
"Ne^'u kho^ng ddu+o+.c cho.n, ma(.c ddi.nh cu?a theme hie^.n ta.i se~ ddu+o+.c du`ng ."

#: config.cpp:170 config.cpp:212 config.cpp:256 config.cpp:271
msgid "Infadel #2 (default)"
msgstr "Infadel #2 ( ma(.c ddi.nh) "

